  "notes": [
    "-IR verb with orthographic spelling change: g→j before *a/o* to preserve the [x] sound (exijo, exija, exijamos, exijan)",
    "Past participle: *exigido*",
    "Subjuntivo stem from yo form: *exij-*",
    "*exigir algo* = to demand something (*Exige una respuesta inmediata* — He demands an immediate answer)",
    "*exigir que + subjuntivo* = to demand that… (*Exigen que los trabajadores lleguen a tiempo* — They demand that workers arrive on time)",
    "Very common in subjuntivo contexts: *exige que*, *exigimos que*, *piden que exija…*",
    "Related: *la exigencia* = demand, requirement; *exigente* = demanding; *exigible* = demandable"
  ],
